      "locale": "en_US",
      "tier": "tooltip",
      "text": "Corki fires a gatling gun in front of him, dealing (80/130/180/230/280 + (240% bonus Attack Damage)) physical damage over 4 seconds and shredding up to 12/14/16/18/20 Armor and Magic Resist. The shred lingers for 2 seconds after being hit.",
      "variant": null
    },
